{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261119/photo/bkn-20261119180616117-1119_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261119182030\"/><p>（左起）普京、習近平、特朗普在麒麟山莊會晤。（Getty Images圖片）</p><p>中國國家主席習近平、美國總統特朗普、俄羅斯總統普京於周四（19日）下午接近4時30分，在廣東深圳麒麟山莊舉行史上首次中美俄元首面對面會晤。會晤於傍晚接近6時結束，歷時約1小時30分鐘。三人會後未舉行聯合記者會，特朗普和普京相繼離場，前往機場。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T10:35:50.145013+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":168,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T10:06:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T10:29:17.598026+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T10:29:17.598026+00:00","content_hash":"7365bf74cb02a5a5565d2090e1f8b2afc9040a17fc64d804c6799e64745e05f4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}